## disk_usage — Disk usage
Root disk usage plus the Docker breakdown (images, containers, volumes, build cache) with reclaimable space and unused image and volume counts.
  {
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "type": "object"
  }

## get_container — Get container
Full detail for one container: command, restart policy, limits, healthcheck, mounts, networks, labels (secret-looking ones redacted), env names and recent events. Accepts ctr:<name>, a name or a container id.
  {
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "id": {
        "description": "entity id (e.g. proj:shop, ctr:shop-api-1) or name",
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "id"
    ],
    "type": "object"
  }

## get_project — Get project
One project with all its workloads (role, state, health, CPU, memory). Accepts an id (proj:<name>) or a name.
  {
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "id": {
        "description": "entity id (e.g. proj:shop, ctr:shop-api-1) or name",
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "id"
    ],
    "type": "object"
  }

## get_topology — Get topology
Nodes and edges of the infrastructure graph (ingress, app, database and cache links), optionally around one entity.
  {
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "category": {
        "description": "only projects of this category",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "depth": {
        "description": "hops from focus, 1 or 2 (default 1)",
        "type": "integer"
      },
      "focus": {
        "description": "entity id to centre on; returns only nodes within depth hops",
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "type": "object"
  }

## get_workload — Get workload
One workload: image, role, ports, networks, environment variable names (never values), ingress routes that target it, topology edges and recent events.
  {
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "id": {
        "description": "entity id (e.g. proj:shop, ctr:shop-api-1) or name",
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "id"
    ],
    "type": "object"
  }

## list_containers — List containers
Every Docker container, running or stopped, with state, health, restarts, OOM kills, CPU, memory and ports. order_by: name, project, state, image, cpu, memory, uptime, restarts, created (default "project, name").
  {
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "attention_only": {
        "description": "only unhealthy, restarting, dead or OOM-killed containers",
        "type": "boolean"
      },
      "order_by": {
        "description": "e.g. \"memory desc\" or \"restarts desc\"",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "page": {
        "description": "1-based page (default 1)",
        "maximum": 2147483647,
        "minimum": -2147483648,
        "type": "integer"
      },
      "page_size": {
        "description": "items per page, 10-100 (default 25)",
        "maximum": 2147483647,
        "minimum": -2147483648,
        "type": "integer"
      },
      "project_id": {
        "description": "only containers of this project (proj:\u003cname\u003e)",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "query": {
        "description": "case-insensitive substring over names, images and ports",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "states": {
        "description": "any of created, running, paused, restarting, removing, exited, dead",
        "items": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "type": [
          "null",
          "array"
        ]
      }
    },
    "type": "object"
  }

## list_events — List events
Lifecycle events, restarts, OOM kills, alerts, proxy reloads and audited actions, newest first. order_by: ts, severity, kind, entity (default "ts desc").
  {
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "entity_id": {
        "description": "only events for this entity (e.g. ctr:shop-api-1)",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "kind": {
        "description": "lifecycle, audit or other",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "order_by": {
        "description": "default \"ts desc\"",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "page": {
        "description": "1-based page (default 1)",
        "maximum": 2147483647,
        "minimum": -2147483648,
        "type": "integer"
      },
      "page_size": {
        "description": "items per page, 10-100 (default 25)",
        "maximum": 2147483647,
        "minimum": -2147483648,
        "type": "integer"
      },
      "query": {
        "description": "case-insensitive substring over messages and entities",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "severities": {
        "description": "any of info, warning, critical",
        "items": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "type": [
          "null",
          "array"
        ]
      }
    },
    "type": "object"
  }

## list_images — List Docker images
Docker images with size, age and the containers using them. filter: all (default), unused, dangling, in_use. order_by: size, created, repository, containers (default "size desc").
  {
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "filter": {
        "description": "all (default), unused, dangling or in_use",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "order_by": {
        "description": "e.g. \"size desc\" or \"created\"",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "page": {
        "description": "1-based page (default 1)",
        "maximum": 2147483647,
        "minimum": -2147483648,
        "type": "integer"
      },
      "page_size": {
        "description": "items per page, 10-100 (default 25)",
        "maximum": 2147483647,
        "minimum": -2147483648,
        "type": "integer"
      },
      "query": {
        "description": "case-insensitive substring over tags, ids and users",
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "type": "object"
  }

## list_ingress — List ingress routes
Reverse-proxy routes from Nginx, Caddy, HAProxy, Traefik and Cloudflare Tunnel: hostnames, listen port, TLS, strategy and upstream health. order_by: hostname, port, proxy, upstreams.
  {
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "order_by": {
        "description": "e.g. \"hostname\"",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "page": {
        "description": "1-based page (default 1)",
        "maximum": 2147483647,
        "minimum": -2147483648,
        "type": "integer"
      },
      "page_size": {
        "description": "items per page, 10-100 (default 25)",
        "maximum": 2147483647,
        "minimum": -2147483648,
        "type": "integer"
      },
      "query": {
        "description": "case-insensitive substring over hostnames, proxies and upstreams",
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "type": "object"
  }

